{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01KmGYj2mKjFzjpF8AjPVoUC", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_13\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saturn_V\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_command_and_service_module\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_Lunar_Module\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_(spacecraft)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Peer_review/Apollo_13/archive1\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skylab\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saturn_IB\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AS-101\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S-IVB\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:59:56.480Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Apollo 13 spacecraft properties \"launch mass\" lb kg infobox", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01ECqx3oW9cB629LMZkfi4JZ", "content": [{"title": "Apollo 13", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_13"}, {"title": "Saturn V", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saturn_V"}, {"title": "Apollo command and service module", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_command_and_service_module"}, {"title": "Apollo Lunar Module", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_Lunar_Module"}, {"title": "Apollo (spacecraft)", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_(spacecraft)"}, {"title": "Wikipedia:Peer review/Apollo 13/archive1", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Peer_review/Apollo_13/archive1"}, {"title": "Skylab", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skylab"}, {"title": "Saturn IB", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saturn_IB"}, {"title": "AS-101", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AS-101"}, {"title": "S-IVB", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S-IVB"}]}, "The Apollo 13 Wikipedia infobox gives a launch mass of 44,069 kg, split into 28,881 kg for the command and service module and 15,188 kg for the lunar module. It does not list a pound figure for that launch mass. Its entry lists the Spacecraft as Apollo CSM-109 and Apollo LM-7, and the same infobox gives a landing mass of 5,050 kg (11,133 lb).\n\nThe separate Apollo 13 article text gives a whole-stack figure, not a spacecraft-only one: including the spacecraft, the rocket weighed in at 2,949,136 kilograms (6,501,733 lb). Don't confuse this with the 44,069 kg spacecraft figure.\n\nFor the component infoboxes, which do give pound values:\n- **Apollo command and service module:** launch mass of 32,390 lb (14,690 kg) Earth orbit and 63,500 lb (28,800 kg) Lunar. Its lunar value is the one that matches Apollo 13's mission profile, but the search results do not show that the Apollo 13 infobox uses this exact figure.\n- **Apollo Lunar Module:** launch mass of 33,500 lb (15,200 kg) standard and 36,200 lb (16,400 kg) extended. These are generic LM variants, not the Apollo 13 LM specifically, so the infobox's 15,188 kg is the better reference for Apollo 13."], "durationSeconds": 6.356553833000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01KmGYj2mKjFzjpF8AjPVoUC", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXj7awDDuokZKcnysjk", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "", "signature": ""}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1318, "cache_read_input_tokens": 6573, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1318}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:00:01.554Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXj7Kootw4AjqJTfV9n", "thinking_duration_ms": 3755, "thinking_display": "updates"}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXj7awDDuokZKcnysjk", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案:约 47,906 kg**\n\n依据维基百科各任务信息框里的发射质量:\n\n| 任务 | 发射质量 |\n|---|---|\n| Apollo 11 | 49,735 kg(109,646 lb) |\n| Apollo 12 | 49,915 kg(110,044 lb) |\n| Apollo 13 | 44,069 kg(指令服务舱 28,881 kg + 登月舱 15,188 kg) |\n\n计算:(49,735 + 49,915 + 44,069) ÷ 3 = 143,719 ÷ 3 ≈ 47,906.3,四舍五入为 **47,906 kg**。\n\n**口径不一致**:Apollo 13 的 44,069 kg 只是指令服务舱加登月舱之和。Apollo 11 和 12 的数值更高,可能还包含适配器、逃逸塔等部件,不过这是我的推测,来源里没有明说。如果三个任务都按指令服务舱加登月舱计算,结果会不同。Apollo 11 的这两部分合计约 43,947 kg,Apollo 12 我没有查到对应分项。\n\nSources:\n- [Apollo 11 – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_11)\n- [Apollo 12 – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_12)\n- [Apollo 13 – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_13)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1318, "cache_read_input_tokens": 6573, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1318}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:00:01.566Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXj7Kootw4AjqJTfV9n"}
